  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ShoreCap III fund, which will be run from the firm&#x2019;s offices in Abidjan, Johannesburg and Chicago, is targeting $150 million to expand access to financial services in sub-Saharan Africa. Equator&#x2019;s first two ShoreCap funds raised $108 million and invested in 25 financial institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
